1
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:18,170
[Four years ago]

2
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,550
Thank you.

3
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:19,510
Hey, young man.

4
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,030
This herb

5
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:22,440
is coffee senna,

6
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,510
not cassia seed.

7
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:25,030
Although they look similar,

8
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:25,920
their properties are different.

9
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,160
They shouldn't be mixed up.

10
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:27,920
I'm not wrong.

11
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,070
It is cassia seed.

12
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:30,720
The gentleman is right.

13
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,159
Apologize to him now.

14
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,520
I'm sorry, Sir.

15
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:34,320
It's nothing.

16
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:36,940
Thank you.

17
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,220
Mr. Zhou.

18
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:40,890
I didn't expect

19
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,390
you to know about medicine.

20
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:44,200
I've read some medical books before

21
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,430
and studied a bit

22
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:46,670
for my wife's illness.

23
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:49,470
With someone like you
taking such good care of her,

24
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:50,640
your wife

25
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:52,490
will surely recover soon.

26
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:54,350
Thanks for your good wishes.

27
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,070
Wang,

28
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,110
take note.

29
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:59,500
It's our shop's fault today.

30
00:00:59,790 --> 00:01:01,250
The herbs are on the house.

31
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:02,630
Miss, we can't do that.

32
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,560
This gentleman

33
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,349
has owed us money several times.

34
00:01:05,349 --> 00:01:06,510
The young master said

35
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:07,840
he must settle all

36
00:01:07,950 --> 00:01:09,070
his previous debts.

37
00:01:09,070 --> 00:01:10,920
Manager, please give me some time.

38
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,050
Just a few more days.

39
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,039
Don't we have an errand out of town?

40
00:01:15,710 --> 00:01:16,400
Mr. Zhou,

41
00:01:16,590 --> 00:01:18,430
if you are willing to make the trip,

42
00:01:18,430 --> 00:01:20,490
your previous debts will be cleared.

43
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:23,070
That sounds good.

44
00:01:23,150 --> 00:01:25,039
But my wife needs someone
to take care of her.

45
00:01:25,039 --> 00:01:25,870
I...

46
00:01:25,870 --> 00:01:27,150
The Qian family is big enough

47
00:01:27,150 --> 00:01:28,950
to accommodate one more person.

48
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:30,700
If Ms. Bai is willing,

49
00:01:30,810 --> 00:01:32,110
she can stay at our house

50
00:01:32,110 --> 00:01:33,479
until you return.

51
00:01:33,870 --> 00:01:35,000
Thank you, Ms. Qian.

52
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,759
Liang!

53
00:01:36,789 --> 00:01:38,390
Pack up Mr. Zhou's medicine.

54
00:01:38,430 --> 00:01:39,039
Sure,

55
00:01:39,039 --> 00:01:39,700
right away!

56
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:40,920
Thank you.

57
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:10,680
Excuse me,

58
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,030
where is my wife?

59
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:13,600
She left with someone.

60
00:02:13,910 --> 00:02:15,020
Who did she leave with?

61
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:16,440
I heard he's quite wealthy,

62
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,280
from a prominent family.

63
00:02:19,250 --> 00:02:20,790
She might just be a concubine,

64
00:02:20,790 --> 00:02:24,000
but she's set for life now.

65
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,390
Impossible.

66
00:02:25,670 --> 00:02:26,590
Tell me where she went.

67
00:02:26,590 --> 00:02:27,520
I'll go find her.

68
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,000
Don't bother.

69
00:02:29,020 --> 00:02:31,079
You'll only bring trouble upon yourself.

70
00:02:31,079 --> 00:02:31,910
Liang.

71
00:02:33,070 --> 00:02:35,200
The herbs in the yard are blowing away.

72
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,680
I'm on it, Miss Qian.

73
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,430
Ms. Qian.

74
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:39,960
Mr. Zhou,

75
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,030
it's...

76
00:02:41,570 --> 00:02:43,130
it's my fault.

77
00:02:45,170 --> 00:02:47,520
I couldn't keep Ms. Bai here.

78
00:02:49,150 --> 00:02:50,610
Do you know where she went?

79
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:54,520
She didn't tell anyone
where she was going.

80
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,680
She just said

81
00:02:56,750 --> 00:02:58,400
she didn't want to suffer anymore.

82
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,150
If she finds a good family,

83
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:02,430
maybe her illness can be cured.

84
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:03,710
If you don't stop her,

85
00:03:03,830 --> 00:03:05,390
she can live a good life.

86
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,710
Isn't that a good deed?

87
00:03:08,870 --> 00:03:09,600
I need her...

88
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:10,910
to tell me herself.

89
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,000
Mr. Zhou!

90
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:21,230
Ms. Bai asked me to return this to you.

91
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:26,680
She said

92
00:03:28,070 --> 00:03:29,870
you shouldn't go looking for her,

93
00:03:29,870 --> 00:03:30,730
and that she...

94
00:03:33,550 --> 00:03:35,150
didn't want to see you again.

95
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:47,410
Mr. Zhou.

96
00:03:58,430 --> 00:03:59,430
Mr. Zhou.

97
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,120
Ms. Bai

98
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:04,140
just didn't want to be a burden to you.

99
00:04:05,310 --> 00:04:07,510
She just wants you to have a better life.

100
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,240
She has good intentions.

101
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,190
Don't let her down.

102
00:04:14,310 --> 00:04:16,110
I'm the one who dragged her down.

103
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,880
I'm the real burden to her.

104
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:20,860
[A Prophet]

105
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:23,820
[Episode 9]

106
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,200
Shangguan Chengming

107
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,570
really deserves to die.

108
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:33,800
But...

109
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,270
Huaiyi,

110
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:38,560
there's really no need for us

111
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,510
to clash head-on with those soldiers.

112
00:06:40,510 --> 00:06:41,270
How about

113
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,090
we just cancel the wedding?

114
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,430
We can get Huaijin and the others

115
00:06:46,430 --> 00:06:47,310
and run away.

116
00:06:48,190 --> 00:06:49,250
Come life or death,

117
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,320
I will follow you.

118
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,830
But I promised

119
00:06:54,470 --> 00:06:57,740
to marry you with a grand ceremony.

120
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,310
That

121
00:07:00,130 --> 00:07:01,590
would be too unfair to you.

122
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:04,560
I'm already wearing the wedding dress.

123
00:07:05,090 --> 00:07:06,120
Wedding or not,

124
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:08,260
I am already yours.

125
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,240
The auspicious time is almost here.

126
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:20,310
Let's perform the wedding ceremony first.

127
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:21,480
You are my woman.

128
00:07:21,910 --> 00:07:24,110
I will never let you get hurt.

129
00:07:46,620 --> 00:07:48,250
You can fool my sister,

130
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:49,950
but you can't fool me.

131
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,800
I'm Qian Lao'er!

132
00:07:53,270 --> 00:07:54,920
Do I look easily scared?

133
00:07:56,190 --> 00:07:58,950
To hell with Commander Feng!

134
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,160
Do you know

135
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,830
why I didn't shoot you?

136
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,720
Shooting you dead

137
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,580
would be letting you off too easy.

138
00:08:08,110 --> 00:08:10,110
I have to hand you over to my brother.

139
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,040
Go down below

140
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,480
and chat

141
00:08:13,390 --> 00:08:14,240
with him.

142
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,560
Set a fire

143
00:08:16,930 --> 00:08:18,970
and escape with your family in the chaos.

144
00:08:18,970 --> 00:08:20,480
Even if Commander Feng catches you,

145
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:22,120
you can say it was an accident

146
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,000
and that my death
had nothing to do with you.

147
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,750
You're smarter than I thought.

148
00:08:32,110 --> 00:08:33,360
But let me tell you,

149
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,030
it's useless.

150
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,390
In a while,

151
00:08:36,990 --> 00:08:38,590
you'll be nothing but ashes.

152
00:08:38,909 --> 00:08:40,240
You won't know anything

153
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:42,390
about what happens next.

154
00:08:43,549 --> 00:08:45,080
So stop worrying.

155
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:56,480
Enjoy it.

156
00:09:21,670 --> 00:09:23,320
The wedding begins!

157
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,380
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

158
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,600
Second bow to the parents!

159
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:49,790
Husband and wife, bow to each other!

160
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,840
Escort them to the bridal chamber!

161
00:10:06,150 --> 00:10:07,390
Ceremony complete!

162
00:10:13,670 --> 00:10:14,200
Wenxin!

163
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,000
Chengming!

164
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,030
Hold on!

165
00:10:19,010 --> 00:10:19,650
Hurry!

166
00:10:32,390 --> 00:10:32,910
Go!

167
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:34,630
Go!

168
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:44,710
Wenxin.

169
00:10:45,860 --> 00:10:47,080
Thank you for saving my life today.

170
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,540
I'm just glad you're okay.

171
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:50,670
You didn't kill their brother.

172
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:51,800
Why did you confess?

173
00:10:51,870 --> 00:10:52,440
Wenxin,

174
00:10:52,830 --> 00:10:54,100
how do you know I didn't kill him?

175
00:10:54,100 --> 00:10:55,610
Because I took the ledger.

176
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,770
In less than 2 hours,

177
00:10:56,930 --> 00:10:59,240
Commander Feng will be here
with his guard battalion.

178
00:10:59,240 --> 00:10:59,960
I'll introduce you

179
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,840
to him then.

180
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,240
I'll go get it for you now.

181
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:02,670
Okay.

182
00:11:02,690 --> 00:11:03,510
Let's split up.

183
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:04,030
Okay.

184
00:11:21,150 --> 00:11:22,030
Zhou Wenxin.

185
00:11:27,610 --> 00:11:28,260
Master.

186
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:30,900
Weren't you drinking in the front yard?

187
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,360
I'll take you to someone.

188
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,720
Master, I don't have time.

189
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:35,720
Let's talk later.

190
00:11:36,090 --> 00:11:36,920
Bai Wenlan.

191
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:25,170
I am Zhou Wenxin.

192
00:13:25,790 --> 00:13:27,240
I am Zhou Wenxin.

193
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:29,090
I am Zhou Wenxin.

194
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,960
I am Zhou Wenxin.

195
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,320
I am Zhou Wenxin.

196
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,600
I am Zhou Wenxin.

197
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:12,790
From what they said, I thought...

198
00:14:12,820 --> 00:14:13,940
I'm sorry.

199
00:14:16,010 --> 00:14:16,860
I'm sorry.

200
00:14:30,150 --> 00:14:31,660
I really am Wenxin!

201
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:32,890
I am Wenxin!

202
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:34,630
I am Wenxin!

203
00:14:40,870 --> 00:14:44,240
I'm sorry!

204
00:15:06,950 --> 00:15:07,880
I'm sorry.

205
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,320
I'm sorry.

206
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:31,420
How about

207
00:15:31,670 --> 00:15:32,710
I trade this

208
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:33,950
for your ledger?

209
00:15:58,700 --> 00:15:59,700
You're in danger.

210
00:15:59,770 --> 00:16:00,700
Come with me now.

211
00:16:03,390 --> 00:16:04,590
Something happened!

212
00:16:05,750 --> 00:16:06,950
Something happened!

213
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:09,800
Something happened!

214
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:11,510
It's nothing.

215
00:16:11,510 --> 00:16:12,240
Please continue, everyone.

216
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:13,440
Something happened!

217
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,560
Keep your voice down.

218
00:16:15,560 --> 00:16:16,110
What's wrong?

219
00:16:16,110 --> 00:16:17,640
Something happened in the dungeon.

220
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:19,970
Take some men to check it out immediately.

221
00:16:20,020 --> 00:16:20,660
Huaiyi.

222
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,040
Is everything okay, Huaiyi?

223
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,000
It's fine.

224
00:16:24,110 --> 00:16:25,540
Keep eating.

225
00:16:32,460 --> 00:16:34,100
Hello, how can I help you?

226
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:35,040
I want to deposit money.

227
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:39,570
One moment. After checking the accounts,
I'll hand you the deposit certificate.

228
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:50,120
Huaiyi.

229
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:51,320
Huaiyi.

230
00:17:05,859 --> 00:17:06,420
Huaijin,

231
00:17:07,410 --> 00:17:08,170
leave now.

232
00:17:10,349 --> 00:17:11,000
Where to?

233
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,960
I don't have time to explain right now.

234
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,640
Listen to me and leave immediately.

235
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:15,700
What about Wenxin?

236
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:16,940
I have to take him with me.

237
00:17:16,940 --> 00:17:18,390
In this situation...

238
00:17:18,589 --> 00:17:19,160
Huaiyi!

239
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,960
I have to take him with me!

240
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,290
Commander Feng's men are here.

241
00:18:12,290 --> 00:18:13,820
Stop talking and leave now!

242
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:32,120
Sect Master invites you to watch a play.

243
00:18:45,310 --> 00:18:46,510
Get up and look at me!

244
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:50,030
Huaiyi!

245
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:54,510
Murder!

246
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:56,070
He killed someone!

247
00:19:33,730 --> 00:19:36,250
Look at me, Huaiyi!

248
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:40,990
Qian Huaijin.

249
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:43,740
Qian Huaijin!

250
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:46,880
This is what you meant

251
00:19:48,170 --> 00:19:50,330
by her leaving with a rich man, right?

252
00:19:53,470 --> 00:19:55,190
Huaiyi was right.

253
00:19:57,800 --> 00:19:59,360
You are...

254
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,110
an ungrateful man.

255
00:20:04,530 --> 00:20:05,960
After all these years,

256
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:09,240
how did I not see clearly that you are

257
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:12,520
a wolf in sheep's clothing?

258
00:20:12,550 --> 00:20:15,070
After all these years...

259
00:20:18,110 --> 00:20:21,590
am I still no match for a village woman?

260
00:20:21,670 --> 00:20:23,600
So you poisoned, muted,

261
00:20:25,030 --> 00:20:26,400
and blinded her?

262
00:20:26,550 --> 00:20:28,640
Poisoned, muted, and blinded her?

263
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:30,480
I don't know! I don't know!

264
00:20:32,220 --> 00:20:34,260
I was just telling my brother...

265
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:36,510
that I liked you

266
00:20:37,550 --> 00:20:39,510
and wanted to be with you.

267
00:20:41,190 --> 00:20:43,710
You've got your eyes on her man.

268
00:20:43,740 --> 00:20:46,060
Why don't you send his woman away?

269
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:48,720
As far away as possible.

270
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:50,360
Okay.

271
00:20:51,320 --> 00:20:52,920
I will

272
00:20:53,390 --> 00:20:55,870
take her to a good place.

273
00:20:56,310 --> 00:20:57,790
Drop the act!

274
00:20:58,050 --> 00:20:59,770
All this chanting and fasting

275
00:20:59,870 --> 00:21:01,440
is all fake!

276
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:02,310
Fake!

277
00:21:02,310 --> 00:21:04,030
Your body and your heart are mine!

278
00:21:04,030 --> 00:21:05,550
All mine!

279
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:08,950
For all these years,

280
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:10,830
I gave you the best.

281
00:21:10,830 --> 00:21:13,720
The best food, drinks, and life!

282
00:21:13,740 --> 00:21:15,590
What did I do wrong?

283
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,400
Your mistake is that

284
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:22,160
I never

285
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,590
loved you at all.

286
00:21:31,490 --> 00:21:35,040
♪ As sleeves rise and fall,
you glance is breathtaking ♪

287
00:21:35,060 --> 00:21:39,230
♪ You brush the dust away,
staying just for me ♪

288
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:44,110
♪ I sing of spring on stage;
our eyes meet down below ♪

289
00:21:44,150 --> 00:21:47,120
♪ Our hearts silently align ♪

290
00:21:47,650 --> 00:21:50,670
♪ You lift my veil and gaze into my eyes ♪

291
00:21:50,690 --> 00:21:53,650
♪ I bow softly,
toasting our years like wine ♪

292
00:21:53,670 --> 00:21:55,670
♪ On this blessed, auspicious day ♪

293
00:21:55,700 --> 00:21:59,880
♪ I'll wait for you,
with a grand bridal procession ♪

294
00:22:05,300 --> 00:22:09,690
♪ I bid wind and snow farewell,
set my opera robes aside, and run to you ♪

295
00:22:09,850 --> 00:22:13,680
♪ We braided hair and tied our knots;
you could hold me close ♪

296
00:22:13,850 --> 00:22:17,440
♪ Red candles line the hall,
with wedding emblems intertwined ♪

297
00:22:17,650 --> 00:22:22,440
♪ With blushing cheeks,
I entrust you my whole life ♪

298
00:22:21,030 --> 00:22:22,880
Amitabha!

299
00:22:23,280 --> 00:22:27,330
♪ I greet spring breeze, light
bright lamps, still waiting for you ♪

300
00:22:27,360 --> 00:22:31,010
♪ Lift the red silk and hand
our wedding quilt; can you see me? ♪

301
00:22:31,040 --> 00:22:34,930
♪ Through all worldly splendors,
I guard this warm moment ♪

302
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:40,180
♪ Dawn and dusk,
we live in harmony year on year ♪

303
00:22:36,550 --> 00:22:42,590
It's okay now.

304
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:55,070
Move.

305
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:22,640
Move.

306
00:23:34,450 --> 00:23:36,510
Pay your respects to the Sect Master.

307
00:24:44,660 --> 00:24:45,580
You fool.

308
00:24:52,650 --> 00:24:53,650
Your ledger.

309
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,400
I'll trade this

310
00:24:57,730 --> 00:24:58,730
for your ledger.

311
00:24:59,160 --> 00:24:59,920
How about it?

312
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:01,030
No need.

313
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:02,800
I have a gun.

314
00:25:13,500 --> 00:25:15,390
Hurry up!

315
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:44,830
Sect Master, you're indeed

316
00:25:44,830 --> 00:25:47,360
the famous fortune teller
of unerring predictions in the southwest.

317
00:25:47,360 --> 00:25:49,730
Unfazed even if Mount Tai collapses
before you.

318
00:25:49,730 --> 00:25:51,900
Unblinking even if a deer dashes by.

319
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:53,990
You flatter me.

320
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:56,640
Commander Feng,
I see you're young and promising,

321
00:25:56,640 --> 00:25:57,880
excelling in both pen and sword.

322
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:59,880
Your future is limitless.

323
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:03,200
You praise me too much, Sect Master.

324
00:26:04,110 --> 00:26:05,350
In your opinion,

325
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:09,270
where does my future lie?

326
00:26:09,350 --> 00:26:11,390
Please tell me your birth date.

327
00:26:11,590 --> 00:26:13,270
The 15th of the 12th lunar month,
28th year of the Guangxu reign,

328
00:26:13,270 --> 00:26:14,290
third quarter of the Rat hour.

329
00:26:14,290 --> 00:26:14,970
Alright.

330
00:26:25,510 --> 00:26:26,790
Strange.

331
00:26:27,460 --> 00:26:28,530
Logically,

332
00:26:28,770 --> 00:26:30,850
you should be from a merchant family,

333
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:32,110
not the military.

334
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:33,160
To be honest,

335
00:26:33,270 --> 00:26:34,750
my family has been in business
for generations.

336
00:26:34,750 --> 00:26:35,920
It was by chance that

337
00:26:35,940 --> 00:26:38,340
I abandoned business for the military.

338
00:26:38,370 --> 00:26:39,480
No wonder.

339
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:42,880
Although you achieved success
at a young age,

340
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:44,160
you nearly died

341
00:26:44,290 --> 00:26:46,490
on the battlefield at 30.

342
00:26:46,790 --> 00:26:49,790
This shows your fortune does not lie
in the southwest.

343
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:51,750
You truly have unerring predictions,
Sect Master.

344
00:26:51,750 --> 00:26:52,960
If I'm not mistaken,

345
00:26:52,980 --> 00:26:54,270
you're facing

346
00:26:54,270 --> 00:26:55,400
a big choice.

347
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:57,270
Choose right, and you will soar.

348
00:26:57,270 --> 00:26:58,920
Choose wrong, and you will be doomed,

349
00:26:58,920 --> 00:27:00,180
even risking your life.

350
00:27:00,180 --> 00:27:01,350
Please enlighten me.

351
00:27:01,350 --> 00:27:02,550
You should head east.

352
00:27:02,680 --> 00:27:03,270
Wuhan?

353
00:27:03,290 --> 00:27:04,270
Further east.

354
00:27:09,310 --> 00:27:10,710
You are truly a master.

355
00:27:11,350 --> 00:27:13,070
If I achieve greatness in the future,

356
00:27:13,070 --> 00:27:14,530
I will reward you heavily.

357
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:16,720
I should be the one thanking you.

358
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:19,070
You helped me clean up my sect.

359
00:27:19,200 --> 00:27:21,070
Blind Du went behind my back
and colluded with the Qian family

360
00:27:21,070 --> 00:27:21,830
to sell

361
00:27:22,510 --> 00:27:23,440
opium,

362
00:27:23,510 --> 00:27:24,830
harming many civilians.

363
00:27:24,830 --> 00:27:27,680
He even used your brothers' corpses
to smuggle opium.

364
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:29,750
It's utterly heartless!

365
00:27:30,350 --> 00:27:33,200
Every single transaction is recorded
in this ledger.

366
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:33,860
Take a look.

367
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:34,480
Right.

368
00:27:36,640 --> 00:27:37,470
This is yours.

369
00:27:48,550 --> 00:27:50,410
The Bashen Powder prescription.

370
00:27:56,070 --> 00:27:57,350
What do you mean, Sect Master?

371
00:27:57,350 --> 00:27:59,550
Thanks to your intervention,

372
00:27:59,590 --> 00:28:02,400
the peace of this region
has been preserved.

373
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:03,830
So this isn't from me.

374
00:28:03,830 --> 00:28:06,360
It's a token of appreciation
from the people.

375
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:08,750
But with such a big incident
happening to the Qian family,

376
00:28:08,750 --> 00:28:09,640
I still need to give an explanation

377
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:11,070
when my superiors ask.

378
00:28:11,070 --> 00:28:11,750
Of course.

379
00:28:12,270 --> 00:28:12,960
Look.

380
00:28:28,790 --> 00:28:30,480
It is truly my fortune

381
00:28:31,440 --> 00:28:34,240
to have the honor
of befriending you, Sect Master.

382
00:28:35,270 --> 00:28:37,160
I will definitely pay a visit another day.

383
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:38,590
I'll be waiting for you.

384
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:18,670
Big Teapot.

385
00:29:19,640 --> 00:29:20,440
Sect Master.

386
00:29:20,880 --> 00:29:22,340
Your mission is complete.

387
00:29:22,530 --> 00:29:23,680
Go back to the hall.

388
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,240
Sometimes,

389
00:29:27,270 --> 00:29:28,360
it's hard to tell

390
00:29:28,890 --> 00:29:29,810
who's the prey.

391
00:29:34,150 --> 00:29:35,150
He has the ledger.

392
00:29:35,220 --> 00:29:36,070
Let me go with you.

393
00:29:36,070 --> 00:29:36,600
No need.

394
00:29:37,250 --> 00:29:39,380
Stay here and keep an eye on them for me.

395
00:29:47,700 --> 00:29:48,760
The ledger is gone.

396
00:29:48,790 --> 00:29:50,250
I need to go see for myself.

397
00:29:50,350 --> 00:29:51,750
What's going on with you?

398
00:29:52,550 --> 00:29:54,880
Will there be trouble if you go?

399
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:55,880
Brother!

400
00:29:57,860 --> 00:29:58,620
Brother!

401
00:29:58,650 --> 00:30:00,080
Wait at the door.

402
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:01,870
If I really can't handle it,

403
00:30:01,870 --> 00:30:03,310
I'll fire a shot as a signal,

404
00:30:03,310 --> 00:30:04,550
and then you rush in.

405
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:07,480
There are too many people around.

406
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:09,960
Why don't we just make a move early?

407
00:30:09,990 --> 00:30:11,880
The finale hasn't started yet.

408
00:30:12,810 --> 00:30:13,810
If we act early,

409
00:30:14,310 --> 00:30:15,920
there will be no show.

410
00:30:15,950 --> 00:30:17,520
Seal the courtyard!

411
00:30:17,830 --> 00:30:18,830
Even if you have to

412
00:30:18,830 --> 00:30:20,160
dig everywhere,

413
00:30:20,350 --> 00:30:22,160
find this person for me!

414
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,930
We can't hide here for long.

415
00:30:24,920 --> 00:30:25,580
Silly prey,

416
00:30:26,150 --> 00:30:27,280
until we meet again.

417
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:29,750
Shangguan.

418
00:30:42,090 --> 00:30:42,680
Master,

419
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:43,920
are you okay?

420
00:30:44,570 --> 00:30:46,000
Shangguan Chengming.

421
00:30:47,500 --> 00:30:48,980
Interesting.

422
00:30:50,830 --> 00:30:54,880
[Yucheng]

423
00:30:58,720 --> 00:31:00,120
Three hundred years ago,

424
00:31:00,170 --> 00:31:02,440
Fang Zhaoyu,
one of the Five Ancestors of Hongmen,

425
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:04,110
founded the Tianxiang Sect.

426
00:31:04,510 --> 00:31:05,270
Since then,

427
00:31:05,510 --> 00:31:08,070
we have allied with
heroes from all quarters,

428
00:31:08,350 --> 00:31:10,960
bringing joy to all the common people.

429
00:31:11,790 --> 00:31:12,640
Back then,

430
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:14,440
your mentor,

431
00:31:14,830 --> 00:31:15,830
Zhang Dancheng,

432
00:31:16,350 --> 00:31:18,280
and I kowtowed together right here

433
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:19,890
to join the sect.

434
00:31:20,350 --> 00:31:21,680
From now on,

435
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:24,200
you are disciples of the Tianxiang Sect.

436
00:31:24,380 --> 00:31:25,910
Loyalty and righteousness

437
00:31:26,030 --> 00:31:27,440
bring wealth and glory.

438
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:29,030
Disloyalty and unrighteousness

439
00:31:29,030 --> 00:31:30,630
share the fate of this lotus.

440
00:31:30,790 --> 00:31:32,090
-I came from the mortal realm
-I came from the mortal realm

441
00:31:32,090 --> 00:31:33,640
-to practice physiognomy.
-to practice physiognomy.

442
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:34,830
-Everything in the mortal world
-Everything in the mortal world

443
00:31:34,830 --> 00:31:36,110
-is already in the past.
-is already in the past.

444
00:31:36,110 --> 00:31:36,650
-Thunder may strike, and fire may burn,
-Thunder may strike, and fire may burn,

445
00:31:36,650 --> 00:31:38,510
-but the wind cannot be driven away.
-but the wind cannot be driven away.

446
00:31:38,510 --> 00:31:39,790
-In life and death,
-In life and death,

447
00:31:39,790 --> 00:31:41,880
-it's all within the art of physiognomy.
-it's all within the art of physiognomy.

448
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:43,680
This is the oath your mentor and I

449
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:45,510
took back then.

450
00:31:45,830 --> 00:31:47,220
Once you enter this sect,

451
00:31:47,220 --> 00:31:48,950
there is no turning back.

452
00:31:49,310 --> 00:31:51,310
My junior and I are like this,

453
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:52,960
and so are you.

454
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:54,550
What a pity.

455
00:31:55,100 --> 00:31:56,440
The person you hate the most

456
00:31:56,440 --> 00:31:58,440
has been by your side all along.

457
00:31:59,470 --> 00:32:01,330
It's just that you couldn't tell.

458
00:32:03,890 --> 00:32:04,960
I am not like you,

459
00:32:06,730 --> 00:32:08,190
changing your appearance

460
00:32:08,590 --> 00:32:09,880
and playing the fool.

461
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:12,500
Under no circumstances
shall I change my name.

462
00:32:12,500 --> 00:32:15,350
My whole family died
at the hands of the Tianxiang Sect.

463
00:32:15,350 --> 00:32:17,150
Today, I failed to take revenge.

464
00:32:17,360 --> 00:32:20,220
I only regret that I can't kill you
with my own hands!

465
00:32:20,400 --> 00:32:21,640
You scared me.

466
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:29,590
Look

467
00:32:30,350 --> 00:32:31,610
how red this flower is.

468
00:32:31,720 --> 00:32:34,890
But in your eyes, it's black.

469
00:32:37,590 --> 00:32:38,350
Why?

470
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:40,960
Because everything you see,

471
00:32:41,590 --> 00:32:42,640
hear,

472
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:44,240
and smell

473
00:32:45,030 --> 00:32:47,030
is what your mentor taught you.

474
00:32:48,720 --> 00:32:50,450
Your mentor is highly skilled.

475
00:32:51,070 --> 00:32:52,070
Too bad

476
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:54,640
he couldn't overcome his greed.

477
00:32:54,880 --> 00:32:56,660
Do you think I'd believe what you say?

478
00:32:56,660 --> 00:32:58,830
Do you think I'd believe you,

479
00:32:59,330 --> 00:33:00,400
Wang Jiaxian?

480
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:05,130
A name is just a label.

481
00:33:06,160 --> 00:33:07,820
Everyone calls you Sect Master,

482
00:33:07,820 --> 00:33:09,350
but are you really a master?

483
00:33:09,790 --> 00:33:12,200
You do things only a coward would do.

484
00:33:15,850 --> 00:33:18,130
No matter what, he saved my life.

485
00:33:18,320 --> 00:33:20,080
If I kill my savior,

486
00:33:20,400 --> 00:33:22,550
who in the underworld
will ever respect me?

487
00:33:22,550 --> 00:33:23,200
Master,

488
00:33:24,270 --> 00:33:24,830
this man

489
00:33:25,110 --> 00:33:26,360
has ulterior motives.

490
00:33:26,360 --> 00:33:28,090
Keeping him around is a threat.

491
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:29,770
It's best to eliminate him.

492
00:33:33,630 --> 00:33:35,290
You haven't eaten yet, right?

493
00:33:35,600 --> 00:33:36,800
Get something to eat.

494
00:34:11,630 --> 00:34:12,550
Are you okay?

495
00:34:21,840 --> 00:34:22,900
What are you doing?

496
00:34:27,190 --> 00:34:28,250
What are you doing?

497
00:34:29,659 --> 00:34:30,179
Bro!

498
00:34:30,550 --> 00:34:31,070
Bro!

499
00:34:34,230 --> 00:34:35,389
I'm Silly Liang!

500
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:38,770
I'm Silly Liang!

501
00:34:42,280 --> 00:34:42,880
I know

502
00:34:43,409 --> 00:34:44,440
you're mad at me.

503
00:34:45,960 --> 00:34:47,400
I had no choice.

504
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:48,920
Sect Master arranged for me

505
00:34:48,920 --> 00:34:50,920
to be the spy of the Longxuya Branch.

506
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:52,350
But when we got to the Qian family,

507
00:34:52,350 --> 00:34:53,949
he replaced me.

508
00:34:54,190 --> 00:34:55,800
I'm just a gofer.

509
00:34:56,670 --> 00:34:58,150
I had to follow orders.

510
00:35:09,070 --> 00:35:10,510
Eat something.

511
00:35:10,800 --> 00:35:12,130
You'll recover faster.

512
00:35:16,280 --> 00:35:17,940
Sect Master won't let you eat.

513
00:35:18,460 --> 00:35:19,830
I brought this for you.

514
00:35:20,400 --> 00:35:22,190
I've already broken the sect rules.

515
00:35:22,190 --> 00:35:23,790
He will definitely find out.

516
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:25,480
I won't escape a beating.

517
00:35:26,440 --> 00:35:29,370
If you don't eat,
I'll take that beating for nothing.

518
00:35:34,190 --> 00:35:35,550
I gotta go.

519
00:35:42,590 --> 00:35:44,400
I haven't told anyone

520
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:47,780
what you said
when you were drunk that night.

521
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:54,320
I'm telling you, bro,

522
00:35:54,320 --> 00:35:56,380
I'll follow you no matter what you do.

523
00:35:56,500 --> 00:35:58,560
What if I want to kill the Sect Master?

524
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:00,520
Don't talk nonsense.

525
00:36:00,520 --> 00:36:02,720
Ruhui, do you really have what it takes?

526
00:36:06,720 --> 00:36:07,470
Liang,

527
00:36:08,120 --> 00:36:09,250
take my advice.

528
00:36:09,670 --> 00:36:11,130
Leave the Tianxiang Sect.

529
00:36:11,650 --> 00:36:12,560
None of them

530
00:36:13,840 --> 00:36:15,300
will die a peaceful death.

531
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:23,200
Push a little harder.

532
00:36:25,070 --> 00:36:25,670
Master.

533
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:28,550
The kid

534
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:30,760
was boasting about killing you.

535
00:36:31,230 --> 00:36:33,030
Why didn't you let me finish him?

536
00:36:34,150 --> 00:36:35,550
Haven't I told you already?

537
00:36:35,550 --> 00:36:36,810
You're doing it again.

538
00:36:37,230 --> 00:36:38,320
You want to use him

539
00:36:39,150 --> 00:36:40,680
to draw out Zhang Dancheng?

540
00:36:41,150 --> 00:36:42,350
But it's been so long,

541
00:36:42,460 --> 00:36:44,790
and there's no sign of movement out there.

542
00:36:45,510 --> 00:36:46,590
What's the rush?

543
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:49,880
I think this kid is quite smart.

544
00:36:50,320 --> 00:36:52,320
He might be of use to me in the future.

545
00:36:52,710 --> 00:36:53,440
But if he

546
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:55,200
really is Wang Jiaxian,

547
00:36:55,880 --> 00:36:57,670
we wiped out his entire family.

548
00:36:57,920 --> 00:37:00,050
And I can tell he's a tough nut to crack.

549
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:01,340
Keeping him around

550
00:37:01,510 --> 00:37:02,510
will be a problem.

551
00:37:12,750 --> 00:37:14,210
Is he really Wang Jiaxian?

552
00:37:25,480 --> 00:37:26,940
Do something for me later.

553
00:37:27,710 --> 00:37:28,480
What is it?

554
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:40,280
I really took a beating for nothing.

555
00:37:43,800 --> 00:37:45,400
Sect Master wants to see you.

556
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:58,880
You're here.

557
00:37:59,550 --> 00:38:01,150
Join us if you haven't eaten.

558
00:38:10,110 --> 00:38:10,880
Yanzi.

559
00:38:12,070 --> 00:38:12,930
Do you know him?

560
00:38:13,960 --> 00:38:15,000
No, Master.

561
00:38:15,150 --> 00:38:16,550
Then I don't understand.

562
00:38:16,710 --> 00:38:17,760
Why would someone

563
00:38:18,440 --> 00:38:20,540
who just narrowly escaped death
at the Qian family

564
00:38:20,540 --> 00:38:22,120
rush to see someone

565
00:38:22,150 --> 00:38:23,800
he doesn't even know?

566
00:38:25,990 --> 00:38:28,420
Isn't it because he wanted
to get the banknotes back

567
00:38:28,420 --> 00:38:29,970
to report to Commander Feng?

568
00:38:29,970 --> 00:38:31,600
Because I wanted to kill you
with my own hands.

569
00:38:31,600 --> 00:38:32,250
For money?

570
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:34,600
For lives.

571
00:38:35,150 --> 00:38:36,790
Years ago, with a song of "Yu Linglong,"

572
00:38:36,790 --> 00:38:38,390
you killed my family of four.

573
00:38:38,600 --> 00:38:40,130
I kept you alive until today

574
00:38:41,570 --> 00:38:43,970
because I didn't want
you to die too easily.

575
00:38:45,960 --> 00:38:46,630
Okay,

576
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:48,390
that's a well-made-up story.

577
00:38:48,390 --> 00:38:50,520
Too bad you're not the main character.

578
00:38:50,630 --> 00:38:51,720
Wang Jiaxian

579
00:38:52,130 --> 00:38:54,260
died in the Nanxi River a long time ago.

580
00:38:55,360 --> 00:38:56,590
What is this nonsense?

581
00:38:56,590 --> 00:38:57,400
One minute it's for money,

582
00:38:57,400 --> 00:38:58,660
the next it's for life.

583
00:38:59,190 --> 00:39:00,390
Let's keep it simple.

584
00:39:01,190 --> 00:39:02,920
If you really are Wang Jiaxian,

585
00:39:03,140 --> 00:39:03,980
kill her

586
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:06,020
and avenge your whole family.

587
00:39:06,470 --> 00:39:07,680
If you're not,

588
00:39:08,070 --> 00:39:08,590
Yanzi,

589
00:39:09,090 --> 00:39:10,380
kill him for me.

590
00:39:10,490 --> 00:39:11,530
Then send his head

591
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:12,920
to my junior.

592
00:39:21,290 --> 00:39:22,620
Don't just stand there.

593
00:39:23,220 --> 00:39:23,900
Do it.

594
00:39:38,400 --> 00:39:39,040
Master.

595
00:39:40,380 --> 00:39:41,780
You're back just in time.

596
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:43,400
I went to the Wang family.

597
00:39:44,060 --> 00:39:46,060
I found Wang Jiaxian's grave.

598
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:49,070
[Tomb of Wang Jiaxian]

599
00:39:51,250 --> 00:39:52,520
I dug it up...

600
00:39:56,440 --> 00:39:57,640
and saw bones inside.

601
00:39:59,590 --> 00:40:01,630
If you are Wang Jiaxian,

602
00:40:02,100 --> 00:40:03,290
then whose bones are those?

603
00:40:03,290 --> 00:40:05,190
You heartless jerks
dug up someone's grave!

604
00:40:05,190 --> 00:40:06,800
That's only because you lied

605
00:40:07,010 --> 00:40:08,300
and made a dead man die again.

606
00:40:08,300 --> 00:40:09,260
Old man,

607
00:40:09,720 --> 00:40:11,550
kill me now if you have the guts!

608
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:15,880
Sect Master.

609
00:41:16,590 --> 00:41:18,250
Ghost Gate Thirteen Needles.

610
00:41:26,880 --> 00:41:29,320
[30 years ago]

611
00:41:29,980 --> 00:41:33,230
[Young Sect Master Zhou Xingsi]

612
00:41:56,710 --> 00:41:58,150
I have searched the world,

613
00:41:58,150 --> 00:41:59,810
but no one can cure my illness.

614
00:42:00,800 --> 00:42:02,800
My father also died of this disease.

615
00:42:03,650 --> 00:42:04,370
Hong,

616
00:42:04,870 --> 00:42:06,130
thankfully, I met you.

617
00:42:08,710 --> 00:42:11,440
Aren't you afraid
I won't be around in the future?

618
00:42:13,140 --> 00:42:14,270
Do not worry.

619
00:42:15,280 --> 00:42:17,370
I have already taught this
acupuncture technique to Zhang Dancheng

620
00:42:17,370 --> 00:42:18,510
and Qin Baichuan.

621
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:20,760
In the future,
whenever I am out on a mission

622
00:42:20,760 --> 00:42:21,820
and not at the hall,

623
00:42:22,280 --> 00:42:24,010
your two Juniors will help you.

624
00:42:24,590 --> 00:42:25,320
Is my illness

625
00:42:25,520 --> 00:42:26,560
truly incurable?

626
00:42:26,840 --> 00:42:29,170
This illness was passed down
from your father.

627
00:42:29,170 --> 00:42:31,570
It tends to flare up
whenever you are tense.

628
00:42:31,640 --> 00:42:33,960
The Ghost Gate Thirteen Needles
can't cure it completely

629
00:42:33,960 --> 00:42:36,400
because you have too many secrets
in your heart,

630
00:42:36,400 --> 00:42:38,660
and they have weighed on you for too long.

631
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:40,030
I have heard

632
00:42:40,280 --> 00:42:43,740
that this acupuncture technique
can capture a person's soul.

633
00:42:44,060 --> 00:42:45,920
Capturing souls is just a saying.

634
00:42:46,630 --> 00:42:47,280
Senior,

635
00:42:48,070 --> 00:42:49,880
the reason you feel relieved now

636
00:42:50,400 --> 00:42:51,770
is that one of these

637
00:42:52,070 --> 00:42:52,920
13 needles

638
00:42:53,280 --> 00:42:55,280
helps you strip away your disguise.

639
00:42:57,460 --> 00:42:58,990
A person without a disguise

640
00:42:59,330 --> 00:43:00,930
is like a child who can't lie.

641
00:43:03,120 --> 00:43:05,250
With the Ghost Gate Thirteen Needles,

642
00:43:06,420 --> 00:43:08,880
we can even summon his soul
for questioning.

643
00:43:13,990 --> 00:43:15,150
But I don't know

644
00:43:15,630 --> 00:43:17,030
if this kid can take it.

645
00:43:17,510 --> 00:43:19,880
He's quite sturdy.

646
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:22,020
Apply the needles.

647
00:43:52,880 --> 00:43:54,590
Who exactly are you?

648
00:44:00,030 --> 00:44:00,920
I am...

649
00:44:09,740 --> 00:44:11,890
[In the next episode]

650
00:44:12,250 --> 00:44:13,210
It's just a meal.

651
00:44:13,710 --> 00:44:14,420
And you're even taking photos?

652
00:44:14,420 --> 00:44:15,410
Usually,

653
00:44:15,440 --> 00:44:16,760
only once momentous deeds
are accomplished,

654
00:44:16,760 --> 00:44:17,880
we have food and money.

655
00:44:17,880 --> 00:44:18,410
Dismiss.

656
00:44:18,920 --> 00:44:19,460
What's wrong?

657
00:44:19,460 --> 00:44:21,940
It must be those jerks
of the Plum Blossom Sect.

658
00:44:21,940 --> 00:44:23,650
What kind of miracle is this?

659
00:44:23,680 --> 00:44:24,430
What miracle?

660
00:44:24,430 --> 00:44:26,150
The immortal children ascend to heaven.

661
00:44:26,150 --> 00:44:27,150
Welcome.

662
00:44:27,440 --> 00:44:30,170
The immortal children
will climb the staircase.

663
00:44:42,280 --> 00:44:43,320
How dare you!

664
00:44:43,320 --> 00:44:44,230
Who are you?

665
00:44:44,230 --> 00:44:46,030
How dare you stop the immortal children
from ascending?
